#   the decision:  docs/decisions/a-location-inherits-its-readers.md
#   the roster:    docs/decisions/an-actor-is-what-it-does-not-what-it-is.md
#   the command:   mise run lint:readers

[attr]contributor         architect coder toolsmith handler reviewer technical-writer
[attr]user                tester plugin-author packager integrator
[attr]agent-instructions  handler contributor

.readers                          architect
README.md                         stem
CONTEXT.md                        stem
CONTRIBUTING.md                   stem contributor
AGENTS.md                         agent-instructions
CLAUDE.md                         agent-instructions
CODEOWNERS                        reviewer

Cargo.toml                        coder packager
pyproject.toml                    stem packager
Cargo.lock                        packager
LICENSE                           packager
deny.toml                         toolsmith packager

mise.toml                         toolsmith
mise.lock                         toolsmith
tasks.toml                        toolsmith
prek.toml                         toolsmith
.editorconfig                     toolsmith
.shellcheckrc                     toolsmith
.config/**                        toolsmith
.gitattributes                    toolsmith
.gitignore                        toolsmith

.claude/**                        handler
docs/agents/**                    handler
.github/**                        toolsmith
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/**         architect
.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md  coder reviewer
scripts/**                        toolsmith
docs/**                           technical-writer
docs/decisions/**                 architect
src/**                            coder plugin-author tester
